<item><title>Tunis medical students plan strike over exams and training conditions</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunis-medical-students-plan-strike-over-exams-and-training-a2ec30/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunis-medical-students-plan-strike-over-exams-and-training-a2ec30/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The students’ organisation says the 23 November stoppage will press for an exam-calendar revision and a restart of internship appeals.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:21:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
